course: dictionary
lesson: 9777
title: Surgical: exact as a surgeon
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Surgical» has two meanings, and the context tells you which one is meant. In a hospital, surgical means to do with surgery, the work of doctors who operate on the body. So «surgical gloves» and «surgical masks» are things a doctor or nurse wears during an operation.
explain: The second meaning is about care. If someone does something very exact and careful, as a surgeon would, we say it is done with surgical precision. Try the swap: if you put «exact and careful» into the sentence and it still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
explain: Look at «A surgical robot moves only when the surgeon moves its controls.» The clue is in the words that follow: the robot moves only when a person controls it, so people stay in charge. Now read «“Surgical strike” means a bombing that is claimed to hit only its target, though it often hits more.» The word «claimed» is a warning: people say it is precise, but that does not always make it true. Always check whether a claim is backed up by evidence.
fact: Surgical means to do with surgery, the work of doctors who operate on the body.
fact: Surgical also means very exact and careful, as if done by a surgeon.
fact: «Surgical gloves» and «surgical masks» are worn in hospitals to keep things clean.
fact: «Surgical procedure» means an operation, and «surgical instruments» are the tools a surgeon uses.
fact: Some people use «surgical» in the news to sound precise, so check the words «claimed» or «said to be» for clues.
exercise: «The nurse put on a clean surgical mask before she went into the room.» What kind of mask is this? | A mask made of gold | *A mask used in an operation or hospital | A mask worn for a costume party
exercise: «She placed the last stitch with surgical precision.» What does surgical precision mean? | Done without any tools at all | Very loud and quick | *Very exact and careful
exercise: «The doctor washed her hands and wore surgical gloves.» Find and copy one word that tells you the gloves are for doctors' work. | doctor | gloves | *surgical | washed
test: «A surgical robot moves only when the surgeon moves its controls.» Why do people stay in charge of the robot? | *Because the robot moves only when the surgeon controls it | Because robots are always slow and clumsy | Because the robot is too heavy to move
test: «“Surgical strike” means a bombing that is claimed to hit only its target.» What does the word claimed tell you? | It is a funny story about a bomb | *People say it is true, but it may not be | It is definitely true and checked by everyone
exam: Which sentence uses surgical to mean very exact and careful? | The nurse put on a surgical mask in the ward | *The cook sliced the onion with surgical precision | The dog wore surgical gloves to the park
